	(text "8. BOILER SSR - powered 5V output, HIGH command = ON"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 220 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "12b78413-2ead-509e-b7cb-7a0358c800cd")
	)
	(text "5. SHARED I2C - 3.3V, Grove/HY2.0 cable order"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "18ca5062-bf0a-5ecc-be5d-e7fd860a1c22")
	)
	(text "4. CAN - TJA1051T/3, 5V bus driver / 3.3V logic"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6b219fda-837a-5000-8d6a-b903c6d29f32")
	)
	(text "6. DIGMESA - open collector, existing RC filter"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 147 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e4f9cda-dc5c-5b0a-9964-c5b7010b2efc")
	)
	(text "Grove opening up: left-to-right GND / 3V3 / SDA / SCL.\nNumbered pads: 1=SCL yellow, 2=SDA white, 3=3V3 red, 4=GND black.\nAddresses: dimmer 0x50 / XDB401 0x7F / TMP102 0x48.\nTMP102 ADD0 grounded; ALERT unused. Mount away from LDO heat.\nPull-ups always fitted: 2.35k effective with XDB401 attached.\n100kHz initial bus speed; remote modules provide local supply decoupling."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230 139 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7cc302ba-282c-5ede-a9f5-ed842bacd99a")
	)
	(text "GPIO36, 3.3V signal / 5V VCC; default LOW."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230 206 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7fa3e931-1a4e-5fab-b9bd-0527430e4520")
	)
	(text "S/SLNT hard-wired low. R11 keeps TX recessive during reset.\nR12 permanently terminates this bus-end node (120 ohms).\nJ3 has no GND pin: power GND must run alongside CAN pair."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 112 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "85eff8ec-8191-5917-b6e7-d22d98ebebef")
	)
	(text "7. VALVE SSR - 3.3V signal / 5V supply"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230 168 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b50ca649-222b-5a06-877a-c2ce89a36a82")
	)
	(text "J8: SSR (-) -> pin1 GND; SSR (+) -> pin2 switched 5V.\nQ3 pulls Q2 gate LOW; Q2 supplies the SSR current.\nR19/R21/R22 ensure off with GPIO floating or 3V3 absent. Shared GND.\nGate pull-up current about 0.5mA when ON; load <=100mA; no mains."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 279 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c471891d-f490-563d-a730-d02d6ba23e23")
	)
	(text "GPIO41 input; internal pull-up disabled. 1k x 10nF = 10us.\nDigmesa powered from 5V; signal pulled to 3.3V only.\nPin order: GND brown / 5V green / SIGNAL yellow.\nRC discharge speed also depends on sensor/cable impedance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 194 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ed54f358-4c86-58f5-bb2b-e9634efdd435")
	)
